{"summary":"Alternate between three siblings in a hand-drawn puzzle-platformer adventure.","description":"A great enemy invasion has struck the archipelagos of Azur, shattering the ancient strongholds that once guarded the legacy of the Courines.\n\nAmid the storm, guided only by hope, you must find your siblings, scattered across Azur, each facing dangers of their own.\n\nIn this hand-drawn, single-player puzzle-platformer, you will alternate control between three siblings, each with unique abilities to outsmart enemies, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover the long-buried secrets of your homeland.\n\nReunite your family and aid the desperate Courines in their fight to rebuild an airship, your only chance of survival. Do it before the Plague consumes your light… and everything you hold dear.","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence, Fear","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Yx8MZXO9sPo?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FrooZDdiWyta-6wp1SXmDdpaoJv6KqdErki13EnG4fvwn54UWJ3431hdidt1PTLGiwcwqwXD5LHo9dvzi9VoWA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rhR3EV_F6DdkL8uL-BCoGyzA1tKlWotzkp0zgjA4H40MUoIP-O0jQiuZDNOgMCWmFUuxrVehS3I7bHkobD4UKw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DJPcuHObDl1bFQICIHOCFVfKzZhWqI0qdyZs2Rp-w0V2tHXAeWs9NwLa0_naXvHUXnqlQFmB4vRt9SbNyK6BAA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tqLGYLwEHgGklg_wbSRUrncH69Mi6tBYUQSd5oaDSg7zTOBZvGDYth5SlK188FOcYuGaEpzLmyflCZtZhK5-_w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bFbI7xWbW2uNUqjZaJN7wyNFqJIlvvudepr2zZWOlE7Bqwh_4NQ_LS4N_lcBg7Ug07iipZmBeEPGKmanxEevlQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0nWJnsWt-mXP59AybKe6CRUEK_mOxEBFUkoB939I04OeibYDzr5mcigQz3D-GYgJtQ3wDfClW4iuT7_VkVBI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7BdO-RSZ-joOR1K52LSquUR1xb-livwwkXf-IUI8HKWchrTdHqfJv6GqBI2hk69BfmAJImNuAGS7OwPz2FHd","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rNjh4ddG3YyNxgUzMsDASOfMSjv4XdxPDwmAHMqFBDJwwSO-Rdxh2CNonsfLEmKiU72zE0x4f_ee